[![](/media/2009/03/IMG_7392-1024x1024.webp)](/media/old/6835f5be-IMG_7392.webp)  
  
Pendiii finali in ambiente stupendo  
[![](/media/2009/03/IMG_7393-1024x1024.webp)](/media/old/337a4969-IMG_7393.webp)  
  
Ecco la cima..la fatica sta per terminare  
[![](/media/2009/03/IMG_7394-1024x1024.webp)](/media/old/80c3d184-IMG_7394.webp)  
  
